{
  "_about": "The weekly leaderboard's rules. The board switches weeks at one instant for everyone: Monday 00:00 in UTC-12, which is Monday 12:00 UTC. An Anki day counts toward the week its own date is in, on the player's clock (offset_west_min minutes west of UTC, rollover_hour). counts_toward says where the player's current Anki day counts at now_ms: board_week (the week the board shows, from board_starts_at to board_ends_at), closing_week (the week before it: a far-west Sunday still running after the reset; the profile's closing_week) or next_week (the week after it: the player's Monday began before the reset; the profile's next_week). own_week_ends_at is when the player's own week ends, the start of their next Monday. The server (src/game.rs, src/reminders.rs) checks it; the Android app and the desktop add-on keep copies.",
